Package: PhysioPipe
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible 'targets' Pipelines for Physiological Signal Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yusuke", "Matsui", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mail.to.matsui@gmail.com")
Description: A collection of reusable 'targets' target factories for the Physio
    ecosystem: drop-in pipelines for the standard single-modality analyses
    (ECG heart-rate variability, EEG band power, EMG amplitude/fatigue, EDA skin
    conductance) plus multi-record cohort branching and Quarto reporting. Each
    factory returns a list of targets so a whole reproducible '_targets.R' is a
    couple of lines, with incremental re-runs and byte-level provenance.
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    targets,
    grDevices,
    graphics,
    stats
Suggests:
